Z||000005||Haze||06-17-2001||04:25 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by cadaver:<BR><B>Hey Haze. I see the lights made it on the car for the show. Can you post a pic. How do I get my car on your site?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hi Tom,<BR> Yep, I put the lights on my car... The wife bought them for her car, but she didn't like the way they looked on a coupe. The cool thing is that I didn't even know she ordered them from you. What a surprise when the mail came.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/015_15.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/019_19_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/020_20_2.jpg"> <P>If you post a pick of your car here Ill grab it off.. If not send me your pics: ( purplehazeracing@yahoo.com ) Ill post you up ASAP...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Take Care...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cooltext2087.jpg"> ||||reg||10
